msgstr "MISSION 01 — ASHES OF THE CAPITAL\nHold the bridge over the Rhine.\n\nMISSION 02 — IRON CORRIDOR\nSever the Alliance supply line.\n\nMISSION 03 — POLAR NIGHT\nCapture the early warning station."

